          "en": "Cards from Jund Artifact Sacrifice are finding their way into the traditional Cat-Oven sacrifice shell, replacing [[card:Mayhem Devil|Mayhem Devil]]. [[card:Biotech Specialist|Biotech Specialist]] and [[card:The Sackville-Bagginses|The Sackville-Bagginses]] certainly have the power to make the cut. deck:95ac01edb226abbbc3b6",
