        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "en": "Golgari Demons is also trying new tools. After all, the previously popular two-drop [[card:Badgermole Cub|Badgermole Cub]] was there largely on raw power, without particularly close synergy with the rest of the deck. A build with a full playset of [[card:Carnivorous Cultivator|Carnivorous Cultivator]] and two copies of [[card:Sanctum Lurker|Sanctum Lurker]] won an event this week: deck:369554e47d28755d2426; another build with a full playset of [[card:Tarmogoyf|Tarmogoyf]] reached the Top 8: deck:fa8c3e7c4011582519ee",
          "zh": "黑绿恶魔也在尝试新组件，毕竟之前流行的2费曲线[[card:Badgermole Cub|獾地鼠幼兽]]单纯是强度高，和套牌其他部分配合并不紧密。本周一个满编[[card:Carnivorous Cultivator|食肉草培育师]]并带了两张[[card:Sanctum Lurker|圣所潜妖]]的版本席卷一场：deck:369554e47d28755d2426；并有一个满编[[card:Tarmogoyf|塔莫耶夫]]的版本拿下一个八强：deck:fa8c3e7c4011582519ee"
        }
